---
/**
 * The three-tier scope gate: which LinkedIn API surface you can reach depends
 * entirely on which products your developer app has been granted.
 */
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 720 480" role="img" aria-labelledby="gate-title gate-desc">
  <title id="gate-title">The three-tier LinkedIn scope gate</title>
  <desc id="gate-desc">
    Tier one, self-serve, granted immediately by the Share on LinkedIn and Sign
    In with LinkedIn products: posting and identifying yourself. Tier two,
    Community Management API, requires vetted partner approval: comments,
    reactions, analytics, reading posts back. Tier three, closed entirely, no
    public API at any tier: messaging and connection invitations.
  </desc>

  <rect width="720" height="480" fill="#000000" rx="6" />

  <!-- Tier 1 -->
  <rect x="24" y="24" width="672" height="128" rx="6"
        fill="#0a1a0d" stroke="#30d158" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="44" y="52" fill="#30d158" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="14" font-weight="700">
    TIER 1 — SELF-SERVE
  </text>
  <text x="44" y="72" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11">
    Granted instantly. No review, no payment.
  </text>

  <rect x="44" y="88" width="200" height="48" rx="4" fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="58" y="108" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    w_member_social
  </text>
  <text x="58" y="125" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    create a post
  </text>

  <rect x="256" y="88" width="200" height="48" rx="4" fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="270" y="108" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    openid + profile
  </text>
  <text x="270" y="125" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    identify yourself
  </text>

  <rect x="468" y="88" width="212" height="48" rx="4" fill="#0a1a0d" stroke="#30d158" />
  <text x="482" y="108" fill="#30d158" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    ✓ postiee works here
  </text>
  <text x="482" y="125" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    post · history · search
  </text>

  <!-- Tier 2 -->
  <rect x="24" y="168" width="672" height="144" rx="6"
        fill="#1c1808" stroke="#ffd60a" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="44" y="196" fill="#ffd60a" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="14" font-weight="700">
    TIER 2 — COMMUNITY MANAGEMENT
  </text>
  <text x="44" y="216" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11">
    Vetted partner review. Requires a business, legal entity, and an
    agreement to the Marketing API terms.
  </text>

  <rect x="44" y="232" width="200" height="48" rx="4" fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="58" y="252" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    w_member_social_feed
  </text>
  <text x="58" y="269" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    comment · react
  </text>

  <rect x="256" y="232" width="200" height="48" rx="4" fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="270" y="252" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    r_member_postAnalytics
  </text>
  <text x="270" y="269" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    impressions · followers
  </text>

  <rect x="468" y="232" width="212" height="48" rx="4" fill="#1c0e0e" stroke="#ff6961" />
  <text x="482" y="252" fill="#ff6961" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    ✗ not in postiee
  </text>
  <text x="482" y="269" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    would 403 on first use
  </text>

  <rect x="44" y="286" width="636" height="32" rx="3" fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <!-- SVG <text> does not wrap: a newline inside one element collapses to a
       space and the whole run overflows the viewBox. Two positioned tspans. -->
  <text x="54" y="298" fill="#ff6961" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    <tspan x="54" y="298">r_member_social — reading your OWN posts — is CLOSED, not gated.</tspan>
    <tspan x="54" y="312">Not accepting requests at this time.</tspan>
  </text>

  <!-- Tier 3 -->
  <rect x="24" y="328" width="672" height="128" rx="6"
        fill="#1c0e0e" stroke="#ff6961" stroke-width="1.5" />
  <text x="44" y="356" fill="#ff6961" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="14" font-weight="700">
    TIER 3 — CLOSED AT EVERY TIER
  </text>
  <text x="44" y="376" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11">
    No product in the developer catalogue. No endpoint in the docs. Explicitly
    prohibited use.
  </text>

  <rect x="44" y="392" width="200" height="48" rx="4" fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="58" y="412" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    messaging
  </text>
  <text x="58" y="429" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    no DM API exists
  </text>

  <rect x="256" y="392" width="200" height="48" rx="4" fill="#121215" stroke="#2a2f3a" />
  <text x="270" y="412" fill="#f5f5f7" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    invitations
  </text>
  <text x="270" y="429" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    no networking API
  </text>

  <rect x="468" y="392" width="212" height="48" rx="4" fill="#1c0e0e" stroke="#ff6961" />
  <text x="482" y="412" fill="#ff6961" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">
    ✗ never implementable
  </text>
  <text x="482" y="429" fill="#a1a1a6" font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="12">
    at any access level
  </text>
</svg>